# Working intelligence, delegation harness and agent instructions.
# These stay local: the public repo is app code and assets only.
BRIEF.md
.agent/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
web/AGENTS.md
web/CLAUDE.md

# Verification + asset-pipeline harness (Playwright gates, anvil fork smoke,
# the sprite build). Unit tests stay in — they document the swap maths.
web/scripts/*
# …except the holder scan, which a scheduled workflow has to be able to run.
# It reads a public RPC and carries no credentials. Everything else here stays
# local; fork-smoke.ts in particular references secrets.
!web/scripts/build-holders.mjs

# Local env. web/.gitignore also covers this; belt and braces before a public push.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Agent worktrees: local scratch, never part of the project.
.claude/
